status GREEN -- glow_lower_shape, glow_lower_named_cast, glow_ident, glow_run_contract, glow_run_desk, width-check, tame_style_check on metal. The hot scoped pass read tree_moved=no and answered two reds of my own: the shelved account's link kept the card's depth, closed by tools/f/fold_shelf_link_repoint.sh --apply with both fold_shelf witnesses GREEN after.
